   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## ORBITAL — motion path\n\n* **Two cores**: ascent model for the first half of the schedule, descent model for the second. `ModelSamplingSD3` shift 5.0 as in the stock template.\n* **24 steps split 12/12, CFG 5.0** — the deck defaults (`steps: 24`, `cfg: 5.0`). euler + simple.\n* **One adapter per expert**: `Lora Loader Model` after each loader, and the same file for both halves only if the author shipped both. `strength_model` is `lora_scale`.\n* **Trigger**: motion adapters fire on a phrase, not a word — put it at the start of the positive prompt. Applies to the same node as the still path.\n* **832x480, 81 frames, 24 fps**. `WanImageToVideo.length` must be 4n+1. `SaveWEBM` writes webm; remux with `ffmpeg -i in.webm -c copy out.mp4`.\n* **Adapter families must match**: an adapter trained for a different architecture loads but renders garbage here — refuse it by family. ComfyUI will not."
   ],
   "title": "BRIEFING"
  }
